Pre-trained models are neural network models that have already been trained on large datasets.
They can be reused for new tasks without training from scratch.
ResNet is commonly used for image classification.
YOLO and FaceNet are used for object detection and face recognition.
BERT, GPT, and Whisper are used for text understanding, text generation, and speech recognition.

